   "source": [
    "# Tier 6 â€” QSDsan: sanitation & resource recovery\n",
    "\n",
    "QSDsan extends BioSTEAM to sanitation and resource-recovery systems. Its streams\n",
    "are **`WasteStream`s** (with wastewater composite variables â€” COD, BOD, N, P), its\n",
    "units are **`SanUnit`s**, and it ships 100+ published unit models plus dynamic\n",
    "process simulation. This tier:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Loads QSDsan `Components` and builds a `WasteStream` by concentration.\n",
    "2. Reads composite variables (COD, BOD, TN, TP).\n",
    "3. Builds a resource-recovery `SanUnit` and a small `System`.\n",
    "4. Computes removal efficiency and recovered nutrient mass."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "94839e7e",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-07-12T11:50:11.998893Z",
